{"title":"May Peace Prevail on Earth","link":"https://kottke.org/26/10/may-peace-prevail-on-earth","date":1792001880000,"content":"\n         \t<p>Here are some photos I’ve taken during my time in Tokyo so far. I’ve been posting new stuff more or less daily <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jkottke\">to Instagram</a>. Somehow I’m already about halfway through my stay.</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791959746-bc9a6e3c.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791959746-bc9a6e3c.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791959746-bc9a6e3c.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791961959-e68df880.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791961959-e68df880.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791961959-e68df880.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791960178-52468b9c.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791960178-52468b9c.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791960178-52468b9c.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791961900-027da27a.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791961900-027da27a.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/editor-1791961900-027da27a.jpg 1200w\" loading